#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:101
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:102
msgid ""
"**Three-font system, clear roles**: Degular Display commands attention at"
" hero scale only. Inter handles everything functional. GT Alpina adds "
"editorial warmth sparingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:103
msgid ""
"**Compressed display**: Degular at 0.90 line-height creates vertically "
"compressed headline blocks that feel modern and architectural."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:104
msgid ""
"**Weight as hierarchy signal**: Inter uses 400 (reading), 500 "
"(navigation/emphasis), 600 (headings/CTAs). Degular uses 500 (display) "
"and 600 (buttons)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:105
msgid ""
"**Uppercase for labels**: Section labels (like \"01 / Colors\") and small"
" categorization use `text-transform: uppercase` with 0.5px letter-"
"spacing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:106
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking for elegance**: GT Alpina uses -1.6px to -1.92px "
"letter-spacing for its thin-weight editorial headlines."
msgstr ""

