#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:247
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Zapier deliberately avoids traditional shadow-"
"based elevation. Structure is defined almost entirely through borders -- "
"warm sand (`#c5c0b1`) borders for standard containment, dark charcoal "
"(`#36342e`) borders for emphasis. The only shadow-like technique is the "
"inset box-shadow used for tab underlines, where a `0px -4px 0px 0px "
"inset` shadow creates a bottom-bar indicator. This border-first approach "
"keeps the design grounded and tangible rather than floating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:249
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:250
msgid ""
"Orange inset underline on active tabs creates visual \"weight\" at the "
"bottom of elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:251
msgid "Sand hover underlines provide preview states without layout shifts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:252
msgid "No background gradients in main content -- the cream canvas is consistent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:253
msgid "Footer uses full dark background (`#201515`) for contrast reversal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:255
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:257
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:258
msgid ""
"Use Degular Display exclusively for hero-scale headlines (40px+) with "
"0.90 line-height for compressed impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:259
msgid "Use Inter for all functional UI -- navigation, body text, buttons, labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:260
msgid "Apply warm cream (`#fffefb`) as the background, never pure white"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:261
msgid "Use `#201515` for text, never pure black -- the reddish warmth matters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:262
msgid ""
"Keep Zapier Orange (`#ff4f00`) reserved for primary CTAs and active state"
" indicators"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:263
msgid ""
"Use sand (`#c5c0b1`) borders as the primary structural element instead of"
" shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:264
msgid ""
"Apply generous button padding (20px 24px) for large CTAs to match "
"Zapier's spacious button style"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:265
msgid ""
"Use inset box-shadow underlines for tab navigation rather than border-"
"bottom"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:266
msgid ""
"Apply uppercase with 0.5px letter-spacing for section labels and micro-"
"categorization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:268
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:269
msgid ""
"Don't use Degular Display for body text or UI elements -- it's display-"
"only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:270
msgid ""
"Don't use pure white (`#ffffff`) or pure black (`#000000`) -- Zapier's "
"palette is warm-shifted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:271
msgid "Don't apply box-shadow elevation to cards -- use borders instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:272
msgid ""
"Don't scatter Zapier Orange across the UI -- it's reserved for CTAs and "
"active states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:273
msgid ""
"Don't use tight padding on large CTA buttons -- Zapier's buttons are "
"deliberately spacious"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:274
msgid ""
"Don't ignore the warm neutral system -- borders should be `#c5c0b1`, not "
"gray"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:275
msgid ""
"Don't use GT Alpina for functional UI -- it's an editorial accent at thin"
" weights only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:276
msgid ""
"Don't apply positive letter-spacing to GT Alpina -- it uses aggressive "
"negative tracking (-1.6px to -1.92px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_zapier.md:277
msgid ""
"Don't use rounded pill shapes (9999px) for primary buttons -- pills are "
"for tags and social icons"
msgstr ""

